# Build-time secret for one-click MyAnimeList login.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and paste your MAL app's Client Secret. Running
# `npm run build` then inlines it into dist/, so the built extension logs in with one click and the
# secret never enters the git repo. Without a .env the extension still works — users just paste the
# secret in the popup once.
#
# The secret IS present in the built/distributed extension files, so only ship builds you're
# comfortable distributing.
VITE_MAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
